And when did this episode air?
那这一集是什么时候播出的？

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:03.360
This episode first aired on January 9th, 2006.
这一集最初于2006年1月9日播出。

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:04.759
Okay.
好的。

00:07:04.759 --> 00:07:06.079
Our first one of the new year.
我们新年的第一集。

00:07:06.079 --> 00:07:07.000
Our first one of the new year.
我们新年的第一集。

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:12.000
and then this led into drum roll, please, episode 13.
然后这就顺理成章地引出了万众期待的第13集。

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:15.360
But let's limit our discussion at least for now to the wedding.
但至少现在，我们还是把讨论限制在“婚礼”这一集上。

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:17.040
You wanna give it- It will be hard.
你想把它——这会很难。

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:18.199
I bid you one last night.
我最后看了一遍。

00:07:18.199 --> 00:07:22.920
I watched him as an hour and it plays so great as an hour that it will be really hard not to talk about it as well.
我把它当成一整小时来看了，作为一个小时的剧集，它实在太精彩了，所以不把它们连起来讨论会非常难。

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:26.480
I made a huge mistake watching both together, even though I loved it.
虽然我很喜欢，但把这两集连着看让我犯了个大错。

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:31.000
I loved the hour of this, but we'll talk about the first half hour and then we'll get to this.
我很喜欢这一小时的连播，但我们先聊前半小时，然后再聊后面。

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:39.240
Well, do you wanna do our quick summary as best you can of what happens in this episode of the wedding.
好吧，你能尽量简单总结一下《婚礼》这一集里发生了什么吗？

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:41.639
Yeah, I mean, it's exactly what we just talked about.
好，我的意思是，这正好印证了我们刚才的话题。

00:07:41.639 --> 00:07:45.759
It's Ted making a plan, coming up with an idea and an aspiration.
这就是泰德在制定计划，想出一个点子，并抱有期待。

00:07:45.759 --> 00:07:47.399
He's gonna bring Robin and his embassy.
他打算带罗宾去参加他收到的婚礼邀请。

00:07:47.399 --> 00:07:49.920
And that has to be exactly the way he sees it.
而且一切必须按照他想象中的那样发展。

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:50.839
Yeah.
对。

00:07:50.839 --> 00:07:57.240
Yeah, it's actually quite like the one of which preceded it in a way where it's like the plan and then watch the plan fall to absolute shit.
对，其实它有点像前面那一集，都是先制定计划，然后看着计划彻底搞砸。

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:59.680
And then maybe something better emerges out of that.
接着也许会有更好的结果从中诞生。

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:01.519
It's a similar structure.
这是一个相似的结构。

00:08:01.519 --> 00:08:06.300
But Ted wants, Ted wants to bring, Ted's feelings for Robin have crept back up, right?
但泰德想，泰德想带罗宾去，泰德对罗宾的感觉又悄悄滋生了，对吧？

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:08.120
And we saw it start in pineapple incident.
我们在《菠萝事件》里就看到了这种迹象。

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:12.199
We saw it when they kissed at the end of the limo, we saw some heat there.
我们看到他们在加长轿车结尾接吻时擦出的火花。

00:08:12.199 --> 00:08:17.079
We saw those embers are starting to catch a little, let's turn this little smoke coming out of there again.
我们看到那些余烬开始重新燃起，那种若隐若现的烟雾又冒出来了。

00:08:17.079 --> 00:08:19.439
And Ted says, I think I have feelings for Robin again.
然后泰德说，我觉得我又对罗宾有感觉了。

00:08:19.439 --> 00:08:23.160
And he wants to bring her to this wedding that they're all going to.
他想带她去他们都要去参加的那个婚礼。

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:36.039
And Ted is convinced he did his thing he always does, which is checking plus one out of this aspirational hope that when he got the wedding invitation and he looked ahead a few months, he would have this belief that he would be in love with somebody and bringing that person.
泰德确信自己做了他常做的那件事，也就是勾选了“加一个同伴”，带着这样一种美好的期盼：当他收到婚礼请柬并展望未来几个月时，他坚信自己会爱上某个人并把那个人带去。

00:08:36.039 --> 00:08:49.038
And I love how the whole episode kind of becomes this symposium on is Ted the kind of guy who always checks that box out of his feeling that he's a couple guy, or is Barney actually right when Barney says, you didn't check that box.
我特别喜欢整集剧集如何变成了一场关于这样一个问题的研讨会：泰德是那种总是因为觉得自己是个“有伴侣的人”而习惯性勾选那个选项的人呢，还是巴尼说得对——巴尼说你根本没勾选那个选项。

00:08:49.038 --> 00:08:57.106
You check that you were going solo because you knew you were going to go there with me and we're going to hook up with bridesmaids and whatever.
你确认自己一个人去，因为你知道你会和我在那里碰面，而且我们要去泡伴娘什么的。

00:08:57.106 --> 00:09:02.765
And I love that the whole episode is kind of this like court case essentially about which guy is Ted.
我特别喜欢整集的内容基本上就像是一场庭审，关于哪个家伙才是泰德。

00:09:02.765 --> 00:09:13.354
And of course, in the end, we find out that I was just spoilers that Barney is right, Ted did not check that, which I think is really, really interesting that Ted did not check at that one.
当然，到最后我们发现——剧透一下——巴尼是对的，泰德根本没勾选那一项，我觉得泰德在这一点上没勾选真的、真的很耐人寻味。

00:09:13.354 --> 00:09:27.809
And it's a weird thing, again, like how memory plays with us and toys with us, you know, like I'm certain I checked that, you know, because I'm the kind of guy, it also is very field of dreams, you know, this idea of like you build it, they will come, right?
这是一种很奇怪的感觉，再次说明了记忆是如何戏弄我们的，你知道的，我确信自己勾选了，你知道的，因为我是那种类型的家伙，而且这也很有《梦幻田园》的感觉，你知道吗，那种“你若建好，他们就会来”的想法，对吧？

00:09:27.809 --> 00:09:28.537
Like totally.
简直太对了。

00:09:28.537 --> 00:09:37.669
He's a man of, you know, he's really wanting to, he's wanting to, he's wanting to create space for this other person, but something in him is like self-sabotaging.
他是一个……你知道的，他真的很想，他想为另一个人腾出空间，但他的内心深处却有一种自我破坏的倾向。

