And the reason for cause really close to my heart, close to it, it's the doctor who is the expert and in condition my son has and also works just with the larger pediatric congenital heart population doing research to help kids like that.
之所以这样做，是因为这件事深深触动了我的心，非常贴近我的内心：那位医生是专家，不仅精通我儿子所患的疾病，还与更大的儿科先天性心脏病群体一起工作，进行研究以帮助像他这样的孩子。

